// Title: File Download Using Notepad++ GUP Utility
// Rule ID: 44143844-0631-49ab-97a0-96387d6b2d7c
// Severity: high
// Tags: attack.command-and-control, attack.t1105
// Category: process_creation
// Product: windows
// Pipeline: microsoft_xdr
